and V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\land S\\in V\\\\&amp;\\land|I|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\varepsilon\\notin I\\land P_0\\subseteq V\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\\\&amp;\\land P_+\\subseteq V\\times V\\times I\\land P_-\\subseteq V\\times I\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\\\&amp;\\land|P_0|,|P_+|,|P_-|&lt;\\aleph_0].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>P₀ 编码 A→α，P₊ 编码 A→Bf，P₋ 编码 Af→α。把 P 分成三个有限分量只区分规则形状；词的实际指标栈语义由后续定义给出，不把指标串当作额外终结词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$G$ 为候选五元组。$V$ 是非终结符集，$I$ 是有限指标集，$P_0,P_+,P_-$ 用不同的元组类型编码三种产生式；有限词见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"P_0,P_+,P_-","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists V,I,P_0,P_+,P_-,S\\;[&G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)\\land V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\land S\\in V\\\\&\\land|I|<\\aleph_0\\land\\varepsilon\\notin I\\land P_0\\subseteq V\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\\\&\\land P_+\\subseteq V\\times V\\times I\\land P_-\\subseteq V\\times I\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\\\&\\land|P_0|,|P_+|,|P_-|<\\aleph_0].\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2068,"backlinks":[{"id":"bfefeed9666846e4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $G=(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)$ 满足 $\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G)$，见 [[73-df-indexed-grammar-structure]]。$a\\in\\Sigma$、$A,B\\in V$、$\\sigma\\in I^*$、$\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$；$\\mathsf T,\\mathsf N$ 是下式给出的带标签符号构造。$x,y\\in\\Omega_G^{<\\omega}$。闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-347","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-indexed-grammar-structure|指标文法的三类有限产生式]]"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}